    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0043_d4dcdfa380fc.png\"><br />Shortes distance (CD) $=\\left|\\frac{\\overline{\\mathrm{AB}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{q}}}{|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{q}}|}\\right|$\n$\\begin{aligned} & =\\left|\\frac{(0 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+2 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}+2 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}) \\cdot(-15 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+7 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}+9 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}})}{\\sqrt{355}}\\right| \\\\ & =\\frac{0+14+18}{\\sqrt{355}}=\\frac{32}{\\sqrt{355}} \\\\ & \\therefore \\mathrm{m}+\\mathrm{n}=32+355=387\\end{aligned}$"
